{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は沈金でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リスナー大感謝祭THANKS WEEK\nということで\nまず、ゲストが二組！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21時台は卜部功也選手\n22時台はJuice＝Juiceさんが\n来てくださいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の中田的には\nあの卜部選手だ～！！という感じでした！w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"K-1の方だけど\nとても優しそうな雰囲気だったし\nいろんな事を知れて楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、大好きなJuice＝Juiceさんと\nお久しぶりにお会いできました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高木さんが好きって言ってるけど\nJuice＝Juiceさんの\n歌とかダンスとかバランスいい感じとか\nグループ自体が好きなんです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に可愛くて幸せでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、16thシングルアンダー曲の\n『ブランコ』の解禁でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"解禁日でも曲フリしちゃったよ！\nイントロ全然聴けなかったと思うけどごめんね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかがでしたかね？\n乃木坂初のラップ楽曲を歌えて\n中田は嬉しいです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVも一足お先に観たんだけど\nみんな可愛かったし\nみんな映ってて\nすごい良いMVだったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期待してて～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、\n富士急ハイランドのフリーパスを\nペア３組６名様にプレゼントさせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田も仮装して富士急ハロウィンしたい～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たった方々、おめでとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は個別です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"習慣的にチェックしてるサイトやアプリはある？乃木坂のブログとか乃木坂関連以外で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意料理は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\n答えを教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう家でてる方も多いでしょう...\nブログぎりぎりの更新でごめんね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/23/8338777/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}